      <h2 class="section-title">9. Fit in the A[i]gents Suite</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Upstream:</strong> Workflow A[i]gent and other systems generate operational artifacts where signals live.</li>
        <li><strong>Core:</strong> Listening A[i]gent structures feedback into a consistent taxonomy and triage loop.</li>
        <li><strong>Downstream:</strong> Innovation A[i]gent picks up systemic issues as experiment candidates; Metrics A[i]gent reports progress.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
