<section class="chapter" id="risks">
  <div class="panel panel--cool">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">10. Risks &amp; Mitigations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> “Listening” becomes surveillance.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> non-invasive inputs, clear boundaries, access controls.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Anonymous dumping ground with no action.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> ownership required, closed-loop metrics.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Misinterpretation without context.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> human review, preserve sources, avoid black-box scoring.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Leaders use signals for performance scoring.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> policy guardrails + audit trail + restricted outputs.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

